    "handle": "popper-18cm-130g",
    "title": "Glide Popper",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Popper 16cm-100g</strong><br />A 16cm-100g popper with a similar shape to the wide-mouthed pop130 and pop150 models, this popper100’s mouth has been designed to produce a loud sound with little effort thanks to a shallow, wide mouth.<br />Its size and weight make it easy to cast for hours and have already replaced the old cone-shaped model on several fishing trips.</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Popper 18cm-130g</strong><br />It has a good diameter of the mouth, it’s a popper that make big pops but with a slightly more contained weight if compared to the 150g.<br />The body has a great buoyancy and a lot of resin to have greater strength and minimize damage from the bites of large predators.</p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Popper 20cm-150g</strong><br />The new version of the old 180.<br />The body has a great buoyancy and a lot of resin to have greater strength and minimize damage from the bites of large predators.</p>",
